{"full":"hf:ysharma/OPF-SmartRedact-Paste","spaceId":"ysharma/OPF-SmartRedact-Paste","name":"OPF PII Pastebin","source":"huggingface","description":"Paste PII, share redacted view using OAI Privacy Filter","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":6,"created":"2026-04-22T09:00:13.000Z","updated":"2026-04-23T17:55:29.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://ysharma-opf-smartredact-paste.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ysharma/OPF-SmartRedact-Paste","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:09.042Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:09.042Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:56:09.042Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"📚","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A paste-to-share service with OpenAI Privacy Filter wired into the critical path. Authors paste sensitive text and get two URLs:","It's a demo of a pattern that doesn't fit gr.Blocks cleanly. gr.Blocks maps one event to one function call on a given session. A pastebin needs:","gr.Server gives you a FastAPI app you decorate with the usual @server.get / @server.post while still getting Gradio API endpoints for the gradioclient SDK. Perfect fit."],"features":["a public view link that serves the OPF-redacted version (placeholders like instead of the original PII);","a private reveal link (guarded by an unguessable token) that serves the original to the author or anyone they deliberately share the reveal URL with.","Persistent server-side state keyed by a short URL — the paste must outlive any single session and be reachable by anyone at /view/{id}.","Two distinct GET routes for the same resource — one public, one token-gated — served as real HTML pages (not component updates).","A background cleanup task independent of any request, that sweeps pastes that have passed their TTL."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ysharma/OPF-SmartRedact-Paste/